      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The next morning, Barinov finds a strange car parked in his usual space behind the restaurant. The driver turns out to be Elena, the chef from the Italian place next door. Their first meeting comes in the local language.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто поставил сюда эту старую машину?",
      "gap": 0.55
